      "category": "sequence_interest",
      "rationale": "Anchor positions to recency across all four category models: the rightmost occupied position receives ID 1, preceding occupied positions receive increasing IDs, and padding remains 0. The generated predictor imports this same model class, so appended-mask inference uses the identical position construction without changing checkpoint shapes.",
      "edits": [
